WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
so many son this this

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:04,760
Dad, take it and build a new prison house for your family.

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,360
Make new clothes for my little sister

4
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:15,660
Next spring, Brother Niu, who bought a strong man, is leaving.

5
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,020
You have to be obedient at home and take good care of your parents.

6
00:00:18,380 --> 00:00:21,940
Then brother, will you come back? What is this?

7
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,260
peach tree seeds

8
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,860
You plant it in the yard

9
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:26,820
