13
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:36,880
Then I water it every day

14
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:43,620
Watch it grow up and go away every day, look at it quickly

15
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,100
That's Chenjiacun over there

16
00:00:53,770 --> 00:00:55,850
Chenjiacun, what a pity

17
00:00:56,250 --> 00:00:58,130
Fifty years ago, I was captured by someone from the Bullying Sect.

18
00:00:58,730 --> 00:01:01,730
By the time we rushed over, it was already too late for the battle.

19
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:09,700
There was not a single fire outlet left in Chenjiacun. What were the demon thieves really doing? Lin Mo

20
00:01:10,540 --> 00:01:14,530
You, why don't you speak? What are you saying?

21
