You are also from our village

24
00:01:22,580 --> 00:01:23,580
Later at Ziyimen

25
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:27,020
We need to take care of each other, we must take care of each other

26
00:01:27,100 --> 00:01:29,100
You are the true disciple of the inner sect who is a genius with all the skills.

27
00:01:29,260 --> 00:01:32,300
