35
00:01:54,710 --> 00:01:57,110
Three taels per month pays for three meals

36
00:01:57,390 --> 00:01:58,670
There are also benefits during holidays

37
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:00,020
Practice hard

38
00:02:00,180 --> 00:02:02,900
Strive to give birth to an inner child as soon as possible and practice hard

39
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:03,900
What don't you understand?

40
00:02:04,020 --> 00:02:06,780
There is an elder's lecture on the first day of every month. You can go and listen. Thank you, brother.

